/E (Recent research has focused on radar-absorbing grilles \(RAGs\) installed at aircraft engine inlets, which allow airflow while absorbing radar waves. By incorporating indium tin oxide \(ITO\) films, scientists have optimized impedance characteristics, achieving broadband absorption and high angular stability.)
